    <p class="text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400 mt-2">Chest acupressure targets the breastbone and upper chest for respiratory comfort, emotional release, and calming restless breathing. This guide covers five key chest points and the safety rules that matter for at-home use.</p>
  </div>
